<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes :ttttttt  nttttttt  n1tThese Financial results have been prepared in accordance with the recognition and measurement principles of Indian Accounting Standards ( Ind AS ) prescribed under section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and read with the relevant rules issued thereunder and the other accounting principles generally accepted in India.tttttt  nttttttt  nttttttt  n2tThe above results have been reviewed by  Audit Committee and the Board of Directors have approved the above results at their meeting held on 12th February, 2021. The Statutory Auditors of the Company have carried out limited review of the Financial Results.tttttt  nttttttt  nttttttt  n3tThe Company is in the business of manufacturing of Specialty Chemicals for Pharmaceutical and Oilfield Chemicals (Completion Fluids) industries. There is only one reportable segment in accordance with Ind AS 108 - Operating Segments. tttttt  nttttttt  nttttttt  n4tThe Company has offered through the Initial Public Offer (IPO) 93,52,941 Equity Shares having face value of Rs. 10/- each at an issue price of Rs. 340/- per Equity Share, comprising offer for sale of 45,00,000 equity shares by Selling Shareholders and fresh issue of 48,52,941 equity shares. These equity shares were allotted on 29th September, 2020 and were listed on 1st October, 2020 on BSE Limited and National Stock Exchange of India Limited.tttttt  nttttttttttttt  nttttttt  n6tThe Statement also includes the results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31. 2019 presented based on the information compiled by the management in accordance with Ind AS, which have not been subjected to review by auditors. However. the management has exercised necessary due diligence to ensure that the financial results for these periods provide a true and fair view of the Company's affairs.ttttttt  nttttttt  n5tThe utilisation of the net IPO proceeds is summarised below:ttttt  nFunding Capital expenditure towards expansion of Manufacturing Facility- As per objects: Rs. 4,103.30, Revised Cost Rs. 4,103.30, utilisation till 31-Dec-20: Rs.429.11 and Unutilised amounts as on 31-Dec-20: Rs. 3,674.19  n   nFunding Incremental working capital requirement- As per objects: Rs. 9,000.00, Revised Cost Rs. 9,000.00, utilisation till 31-Dec-20: Rs.4,000.00 and Unutilised amounts as on 31-Dec-20: Rs. 5,000.00  n  nFunding General corporate purposes* - As per objects: Rs. 1,875.50, Revised Cost Rs. 1,924.68, utilisation till 31-Dec-20: Rs. 845.14 and Unutilised amounts as on 31-Dec-20: Rs. 1,079.54t  nt  n* The revision in General corporate purposes expense is on account of reduction in offer expenses as compared to estimated.tttttt  nIPO Proceeds which were unutilised as at December 31, 2020 were temporarily invested in deposits with scheduled commercial bank.ttttttt  nttttttt  nttttttt  n7tCovid-19 pandemic has caused disruption to businesses and economic activity which has been reflected in recent fluctuations in markets across the globe. The Company has considered relevant internal and external sources of information and its impact on the recoverability of financial and non-financial assets while preparation of these financial results. The Company will continue to closely monitor any material changes to future economic conditions.tttttt  nttttttt  nttttttt  nttttttt  n8tThe figures for the corresponding previous periods have been regrouped wherever considered necessary to conform to the figures represented in the current period.tttttt  nttttttt  n9tThe above Unaudited Financial Results of the Company are available on the Company's website www.cscpl.com and also on the website of BSE (www.bseindia.com) and NSE (www.nseindia.com), where the shares of the Company are listed.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
